{"title":"Career Roadmap: Social Media Manager","role":"Social Media Manager","summary":"A Social Media Manager plans, creates, publishes, manages and measures content across social platforms.","facts":{"Current degree":"BA (Bachelor of Arts - General / Honours)","Course":"Media & Communication / Digital Media / Podcasting"},"about":[{"label":"Primary Goal","text":"Build expertise in social media strategy, content creation, audience growth, analytics, digital marketing, community management and brand communication"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Roadmap Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Social Media Manager plans, creates, publishes, manages and measures content across social platforms."},{"type":"p","text":"The role combines:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Social media strategy"},{"text":"Content planning"},{"text":"Copywriting"},{"text":"Video and audio content"},{"text":"Community management"},{"text":"Digital marketing"},{"text":"Audience analytics"},{"text":"Influencer/creator collaboration"},{"text":"Brand communication"},{"text":"Campaign management"},{"text":"Social listening"},{"text":"Reputation management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A BA in Media & Communication/Digital Media provides a strong foundation, but the student should add marketing, analytics, content production and platform-specific skills."},{"type":"p","text":"A graduate may initially enter as a Social Media Executive, Social Media Associate, Content Executive or Community Executive before progressing to Social Media Manager."}]},{"heading":"What to Build During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Learn From","Proof of Skill","Gap to Avoid"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Communication & content foundation"},{"text":"Media, writing, storytelling, digital culture"},{"text":"Content portfolio"},{"text":"Only theoretical media study"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Social m